# pi agent harness (.pi/extensions is source and IS tracked)
.pi/logs/

# Licensed pixel-art pack: usable locally and shippable inside a built game,
# but the raw PNGs are not redistributed from this public repository.
# Remove this line if your licence permits redistributing the source assets.
# Purchased 16-bit asset pack: NOT redistributed.
#
# The owner's licence covers using the pack in this product, which is not the
# same as republishing the artwork. So the pack stays out of the repository
# except for the handful of UI frames the engine chrome actually draws with --
# the dialogue plate, the heart HUD, two emotes, the arrow and the pixel face.
# Character art, monsters, terrain and the other ~1850 files are never
# published; PixelPack.ready()/has() report what is missing and the engine
# falls back on its own drawing, so a clone runs correctly without them.
#
# git cannot look inside an ignored directory, so each level is re-opened
# before its files can be excepted.
assets/pixelpack/*
!assets/pixelpack/catalog.json
!assets/pixelpack/ui/
assets/pixelpack/ui/*
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Arrow.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Dialog/
assets/pixelpack/ui/Dialog/*
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Dialog/DialogBox.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Dialog/DialogBoxFaceset.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Dialog/DialogueBoxSimple.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Dialog/FacesetBox.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Receptacle/
assets/pixelpack/ui/Receptacle/*
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Receptacle/Heart.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Emote/
assets/pixelpack/ui/Emote/*
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Emote/emote5.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Emote/emote12.png
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Font/
assets/pixelpack/ui/Font/*
!assets/pixelpack/ui/Font/NormalFont.ttf

